<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Audit the Whisper: Detecting Steganographic Collusion in Multi-Agent LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
