<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Audit the Whisper: Detecting Steganographic Collusion in Multi-Agent LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Operational guidance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Audit the Whisper: Detecting Steganographic Collusion in Multi-Agent LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Audit the Whisper: Detecting Steganographic Collusion in Multi-Agent LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Future work.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
